source('ranks','Mayo Media Week 4 rankings','https://mayomedia.substack.com/p/2026-week-4-fantasy-football-rankings','2026-09-30; rankings updated 2026-09-29','Half-PPR opinion: Hurts above Stroud; Mahomes above Nix; Jones slightly above Herbert. Johnson above Kraft; Burden above McConkey. These are not custom-scoring projections. Injury predictions yield to newer official reports.','Analyst rankings')
